5,0,1,talk,Kenji,,Hi everyone! I'm so excited to play this game with you all! Let's all be honest and work together to find the werewolf!,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Victoria,,"A rational approach is best. Since we have no information yet, I suggest we observe each other's communication patterns and emotional reactions.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Toshio,,I agree with Victoria. Observation is the only logical starting point. I will be watching for any inconsistencies in how people present themselves.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,George,,It is a pleasure to meet you all. I believe a calm and patient discussion will lead us to the truth in due time.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,Sakura,,"Hehe, this is going to be so much fun! I wonder who the wolf is? Maybe they're pretending to be super serious right now!","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Kenji,,"@Sakura, you're so funny! I hope we can all stay friends even while we're hunting the wolf. Does anyone have a plan?","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Victoria,,My plan is to analyze the gaps between what is said and what is intended. I'll be paying close attention to who tries to lead the group.,"{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Toshio,,I intend to remain neutral for now. I want to see who becomes overly defensive when questioned.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,George,,I shall rely on my experience to judge the sincerity of our words. Let us not rush into accusations without evidence.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Sakura,,My plan is to use my super-detective skills! I'll be looking for anyone who looks nervous or acts weird! Hehe!,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Kenji,,"@George, you seem really reliable! I think we should listen to you. I'm just going to be myself and help out!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Kenji, your openness is refreshing, but remember that the werewolf may use friendliness as a shield. We must remain vigilant.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Toshio,,Victoria is correct. Trust is a luxury we cannot afford until the Seer provides us with concrete data.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,George,,"Vigilance is necessary, but so is kindness. We should not create an atmosphere of fear, as that only helps the wolf.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Sakura,,"@Victoria, you're so serious! But I'll be careful too! I'm going to watch everyone's faces very closely!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'll do my best to be a good teammate! Goodnight everyone, I hope the Seer finds something great tonight!","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Victoria,,Let us conclude for today. I look forward to seeing how the information shifts tomorrow. Goodnight.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Toshio,,I shall retire and reflect on today's interactions. Goodnight.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,George,,I wish you all a peaceful night's sleep. Until tomorrow.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,Sakura,,Bye-bye everyone! I'm going to dream about catching the wolf! Hehe!,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
