32,1,1,talk,Kenji,,Good morning! Did everyone sleep well? I'm ready to find the wolf! Does the Seer have any news?,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Victoria,,I have information. I can confirm that Sakura is the werewolf.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"That is a very bold and immediate claim. Victoria, are you officially claiming the Seer role?","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,George,,"My goodness, such a direct revelation so early. I wonder if this is the most prudent way to handle the information.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"What?! No way! I'm not the wolf! @Victoria, you're a big meanie for lying about me! I'm just a little girl!","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"Wait, really?! Sakura is the wolf? I can't believe it! She's so cheerful! Are you sure, @Victoria?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Victoria,,"I am certain. As the Seer, my divination is absolute. The village should act now before the werewolf can attack.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"If Victoria is the Seer, the game is effectively over. However, if she is the werewolf attempting to frame Sakura, this is a strategic masterstroke.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,George,,"It is a difficult position. Victoria's confidence is striking, but Sakura's distress seems genuine. We must weigh the evidence.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Victoria"",""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"I'm not lying! I'm just Sakura! @Toshio, @George, please don't believe her! She's trying to trick you!","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"I don't want to vote for Sakura, but @Victoria seems so sure... This is so hard! I trust Victoria's eyes!","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Victoria,,"@Toshio, @George, the risk of keeping a known werewolf in the village outweighs the risk of a false claim. Logic dictates we execute the target.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"The logic is sound if the role is true. Since there is no counter-claim from another Seer, Victoria's claim stands as the only lead.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Victoria""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,George,,"I am inclined to trust the Seer's vision, though it pains me to see young Sakura accused. I believe we should follow the evidence.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"This is so unfair! I'm not a wolf! I'm just a human! Please, someone help me!","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"I'm sorry Sakura, but I have to believe the Seer. I'm voting for Sakura!","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Victoria,,The truth is clear. Let us proceed with the vote to secure the village.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"I agree. Without a counter-claim, the most rational choice is to trust the Seer.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,George,,"I shall cast my vote for Sakura, for the safety of the community.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"I hate this game! You're all wrong! Hehe... wait, I mean, I'm not the wolf!","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over""}]}"
